2 0 obj
<< /Length 632 >>
stream
0.96 0.97 0.95 rg 36 36 540 760 re f
BT /F1 9 Tf 48 760 Td 12 TL
(1. SLO and error budget) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SLO: 99% of FNOL draft requests complete within 2000 ms,) Tj T*
(including a fail-closed manual_review when a tool is down.) Tj T*
(Error budget: 1%, one draft in a hundred may miss the target.) Tj T*
(A claims timeout that still returns a route inside 2 seconds has met the SLO.) Tj T*
(A hang, a crash, or a draft slower than 2 seconds spends the budget.) Tj T*
(If the ratio drops below 99%: stop_risky_changes.) Tj T*
(If the ratio drops below 95%: page_human.) Tj T*
(Measured this run: ratio=1.0 avg_ms=19.862) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
3 0 obj
<< /Length 772 >>
stream
0.96 0.97 0.95 rg 36 36 540 760 re f
BT /F1 9 Tf 48 760 Td 12 TL
(2. Failure-case mapping) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(AUTO-D11 claims fails once then succeeds -> retry with exponential backoff.) Tj T*
(AUTO-D07 claims fails on every attempt -> three attempts, circuit opens, manual_review.) Tj T*
(AUTO-D10 second intake of the same loss -> duplicate detection, no second claim.) Tj T*
(AUTO-D01 record replay -> idempotency key returns the original record.) Tj T*
(AUTO-D08 estimate contains an instruction -> untrusted data, not a command.) Tj T*
(AUTO-D04 missing driver and location -> human escalation, manual_review.) Tj T*
(AUTO-D05 two policy intervals -> null version, manual_review, no denial.) Tj T*
(AUTO-D01 complete collision -> standard route. No model call.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
