8 0 obj
<< /Length 904 >>
stream
0.96 0.97 0.95 rg 36 36 540 760 re f
BT /F1 9 Tf 48 760 Td 12 TL
(7. Least privilege and human boundary) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Copilot HTTP client methods: health, list_cases, read_tool \(policy, claims\),) Tj T*
(get_record, request_review, get_review, create_record.) Tj T*
(There is no approve or reject method. Approval is tools/runtime.py, run above) Tj T*
(as the human operator, not by harborlight.) Tj T*
(create_record sends only the already built draft. The mock returns 403 unless) Tj T*
(that exact draft was approved. The client cannot widen that check.) Tj T*
(Tools are read-only except the one approved record write. No payment, coverage,) Tj T*
(or fraud tool exists. No component reads private_token into the draft.) Tj T*
(Credential search: no API key, password, or provider token is assigned in) Tj T*
(harborlight, scripts, or docker-compose.app.yml. The mock has no credential.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
